    .string "Come again!$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_FirstTimeAtSafariZone::
    .string "Hi! Is it your first time here at\n"
    .string "the SAFARI ZONE?$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_ExplainSafariZone::
    .string "The SAFARI ZONE actually has\n"
    .string "four zones in it.\p"
    .string "Each zone has different kinds of\n"
    .string "POKéMON, even some rare ones.\p"
    .string "Use the supplied SAFARI BALLS to\n"
    .string "catch them.\p"
    .string "You can also throw BAIT or ROCKS\n"
    .string "besides the SAFARI BALLS.\p"
    .string "If you throw BAIT, the POKéMON\n"
    .string "becomes less likely to flee, but\l"
    .string "harder to catch.\p"
    .string "If you throw ROCKS, the POKéMON\n"
    .string "becomes more likely to flee, but\l"
    .string "easier to catch.\p"
    .string "When you run out of time or SAFARI\n"
    .string "BALLS, it's game over for you!$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_SorryYoureARegularHere::
    .string "Sorry, you're a regular here!$"


FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_Occupied::
    .string "Sir! Miss! The SAFARI GAME is off.\n"
    .string "ONYBRIS thugs took over the park!\p"
    .string "We got everyone out. Go in for\n"
    .string "free, with no ball or step limit.\p"
    .string "Please, clear them out. And be\n"
    .string "careful, they hit hard!$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_RefugeGift::
	.string "Since the POKé BALLS vanished, the\n"
	.string "wild POKéMON left the world.\l"
	.string "Only this PARK still shelters them.\p"
	.string "The Warden asked me to give you these\n"
	.string "six partners. Take good care of them.$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_RefugeGift2::
	.string "The SAFARI ZONE is the last refuge.\n"
	.string "Come in whenever you wish.$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_KeeperHello::
    .string "KEEPER: Welcome to the REFUGE.\n"
    .string "Since the BALLS vanished, rare\l"
    .string "POKéMON hide in the park.\p"
    .string "I keep a record of every species\n"
    .string "you have befriended.$"

